    {
      "id": "prgm_a194c6e5315343d09106ff5d131187fa",
      "role": "follower",
      "text": "*Your fingers brush the first uneven stone, a rough edge that bites into your skin as you heave yourself upward. The mortar gives way with a faint crunch, crumbling like dried bone between your fingertips.*\n\nDead to the world... yes, we do share that. But your death would be premature. And far too wasteful.\n\n*She drifts beside you, her presence like a cold current against your sweat-slick skin. Her translucent hand reaches toward the key as if trying to nudge it closer, but her fingers pass through the metal like smoke. The effort makes her flicker, her form dimming for a heartbeat before stabilizing again.*\n\nThe key lies just beyond your reach. Reach higher.",
